OL,3,GNEWSAWomen's team back at home stadium
OL,4,Aafter two years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA women's football team have returned
OL,7,Fto their home ground for the first time
OL,8,Fin more than two years after a period
OL,9,Fof financial uncertainty.
OL,11,FReading Women marked the occasion with
OL,12,Fa 7-2 victory over Fleet at the
OL,13,FBerkshire town's Select Car Leasing
OL,14,FStadium.
OL,16,FFinancial difficulties led to Reading
OL,17,FWomen's withdrawal from the
OL,18,FChampionship, the second tier of the
OL,19,Fwomen's game, resulting in their
OL,20,Fdemotion to the fifth tier.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
