OL,3,GNEWSAWomen's team back at home stadium
OL,4,Aafter two years
OL,5,
OL,6,FAhead of the homecoming fixture,
OL,7,Fstriker Nat Cowell said the squad had
OL,8,Fbeen eagerly anticipating the occasion
OL,9,Fand had been "gearing up to this
OL,10,Fmoment".
